        <!-- ===================== §3 · HOW CLOSE, REALLY ===================== -->
        <section class="sec" id="distance">
          <h2>How Close Are We to You, Really?</h2>
          <p class="opener">Close enough to drive if you live within two or three hours of west Texas; a flight away for everyone else. We would rather say that on the first screen than let a “near me” phrase imply a bird shop on your corner.</p>
          <img class="sec-img inf-img" src={IMG + "midland-pickup-radius-or-fly-infographic.webp"}
               srcset={IMG + "midland-pickup-radius-or-fly-infographic-760.webp 760w, " + IMG + "midland-pickup-radius-or-fly-infographic.webp 1408w"}
               sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 760px" width="1408" height="768" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
               alt="Midland pickup radius and nationwide flight routes from the C.A.Gs aviary">

          <div class="tblwrap">
            <table class="tblI">
              <caption class="tblI-cap">Distance Ledger — how a bird reaches each state we have a page for</caption>
              <thead><tr><th scope="col">State</th><th scope="col">Route from us</th><th scope="col">Cargo counter named on that page</th><th scope="col">What it costs</th></tr></thead>
